while the final was at 2,000 metres."] "\n\n" [:p {} "On paper, the American team of " [:a {:href "/athletes/890355"} "Tom Cooper"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/891095"} "Floyd McFarland"] " looked strongest, but they lost out in the third semi-final, which was won by a mixed national team of Dutch rider " [:a {:href "/athletes/891161"} "Harry Meijers"] " and Italian " [:a {:href "/athletes/891577"} "Gian Ferdinando Tommaselli"] "."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In the final, Meijers and Tommaselli faced a French team of " [:a {:href "/athletes/891080"} "Jean-Baptiste Louvet"] " and, probably, the strongest sprinter in the event, " [:a {:href "/athletes/890867"} "Edmond Jacquelin"] ". In the sprint, the team of " [:a {:href "/athletes/890845"} "Anton Huber"] " of Germany and " [:a {:href "/athletes/891494"} "Franz Seidl"] " of Austria led out, but Meijers and Tommaselli were too strong and came around them to win the final narrowly, with Louvet and Jacquelin not contesting the last 100 metres as they were well back. Meijers and Tommaselli won 2,000 francs for winning, with 1,000 francs going to Huber and Seidl."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/891161"} "Harry Meijers"] " (NED) / " [:a {:href "/athletes/891577"} "Gian Ferdinando Tommaselli"] " (ITA)"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MIX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MIX.png"}] "MIX"]] [:td {} "1:31.8 (1 h4)"] [:td {} "1:34.2 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "3:16.0 (1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/890845"} "Anton Huber"] " (GER) / " [:a {:href "/athletes/891494"} "Franz Seidl"] " (AUT)"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MIX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2